E2E test campaign — db-gateway (micro2 + local rehearsal)
Goal: is it? we need to extensively test it.   Date: 2026-10-15
Scope: the db-gateway as a whole (rehearsal first, then live).
Recorded outputs are verbatim from each gate; every command ran to
completion and is included for the auditor to reproduce.

