  RED at HEAD on tests/litestream_restore.rs (signature/chain wrapping
  under rustfmt 1.9.0-stable shipped with the pinned 1.97.1 toolchain)
  and tests/release_bundle.rs (same cause, pre-existing). Mechanical
  re-format via `cargo fmt --all`; both files now clean. No logic change.
  Commit: 54c380f  style(tests): rustfmt 1.9.0 line-breaking ...

1.2 cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --locked -- -D warnings
